---
// Live Beacon. Offline it says just "Offline"; lib/offline-next.ts adds "Next stream · Thu 7 PM" once the real schedule has one (never a placeholder).
// Public (red glow, with the game's name from public/live) and backstage (green glow) come from data-live on <body>.
---
<a class="bt-beacon bt-when-off" href="/live"><span class="bt-beacon-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span data-next-label>Offline</span><span class="bt-beacon-sub" data-next-sub hidden><time></time></span></a>
<a class="bt-beacon bt-beacon--public bt-when-public" href="/live"><span class="bt-beacon-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Live<span class="bt-beacon-sub" data-live-sub hidden></span></a>
<a class="bt-beacon bt-beacon--backstage bt-when-backstage" href="/live"><span class="bt-beacon-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Backstage<span class="bt-beacon-sub">Members only</span></a>
